abstract: >-
  A reproducible graph-based research platform for studying emergency-response accessibility,
  resource allocation and reliability boundaries under synthetic post-earthquake road disruption
  in Türkiye. The v1.0.0 release integrates AFAD and OpenStreetMap data access, coupled stochastic
  disruption experiments, graph-based assignment baselines, phase-transition analysis and
  world-cluster bootstrap inference.
